The .c files in this directory already contain patches/P1-P5 (applied in that
order on top of the base commit). The patch files document each change.
To get back to the base sources:
    for p in P5 P4 P3 P2 P1; do patch -R -p0 < patches/$p-*.patch; done

P1 (skip_acpi_power / SOCW skip) and the NULL check on sub_hdev in P4 are
based on AJ-dev-i60/t1-touchbar apple-ib-drv/apple-ibridge.c
(commit f089319655853eb90af1ec620ebb6908591f0b2c, GPL-2.0).
